  </knowledge>
  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Failing tests first: To lookup resolving with a pick while focus has been moved to an element outside the composer (simulate the platform): after settle, focus is on the To button. Show it fails on unchanged code.</step>
    <step order="2">Implement one helper used by every lookup path.</step>
    <step order="3">Filtered jest (EmailComposer, DocumentEmailWizard, SendEmailDialog, WizardFollowOns, DecisionWizard email step), typecheck, client-lint.</step>
    <step order="4">Bump and build:prod the PCFs whose bundle changes; build the Console.</step>
    <step order="5">Notes in notes/task-199-notes.md.</step>
  </steps>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: To lookup resolves with a pick while focus is outside the composer → focus ends on the To button. Fails on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: same for Cc, for cancel (null), and for Link a record / Link documents.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative test: if focus is already inside the composer when the lookup settles (e.g. on the body editor), it is not moved.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative test: composer unmounted before the lookup settles → no error, no focus call.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Existing composer and host tests pass unmodified; typecheck clean; client-lint passes; PCF versions bumped where the bundle changed and build:prod succeeds; Console builds.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>If focus cannot be taken back reliably because the platform pane moves focus AFTER the lookup promise resolves (observable only on dev), STOP after the tests and report; the main session will verify on dev.</trigger>
  </escalation>
  <execution>
    <protocol>Run through task-execute. Fresh worktree from origin/master; PR to master.</protocol>
  </execution>
  <completion>Done 2026-11-23: PR #2955 merged to master (1e6ee676d7) after independent review and fix round (1f9e2eedd4). Deployed to dev with task 200 from master 973d72b67e (deploy-log 2026-11-23): CommunicationActions 1.3.25, TrackingFieldTrio 1.0.67, SemanticSearchControl 1.1.92 and the composer code pages. Dev check 2026-11-23 (notes/task-185-notes.md): Tracking email composer, To lookup cancelled, focus returns to "Look up To recipients", and the retry reclaims focus after the platform's late hand-back. Not checked on dev: the Find Similar/DRV and preview iframe paths. Helper moved to utils/focusReturn.ts by task 200. Notes: notes/task-199-notes.md.</completion>
</task>
